{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Uyen Ninh (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uyen_Ninh\" title=\"Uyen Ninh\">Uyen Ninh</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> features her husband in her videos, but never reveals his face or name?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uyen_Ninh","retrieved":1790417152666},{"title":"Gold Crown from Cheonmachong (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the tree and antler shapes of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold_Crown_from_Cheonmachong\" title=\"Gold Crown from Cheonmachong\">Gold Crown from Cheonmachong</a></b> represent the connection between heaven and earth?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold_Crown_from_Cheonmachong","retrieved":1790417152670},{"title":"John Vipond Davies (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Vipond_Davies\" title=\"John Vipond Davies\">John Vipond Davies</a></b> played rugby for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiff_RFC\" title=\"Cardiff RFC\">Cardiff FC</a> before moving to the United States to help build tunnels?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Vipond_Davies","retrieved":1790417152672},{"title":"Sinlahekin Fire (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinlahekin_Fire\" title=\"Sinlahekin Fire\">Sinlahekin Fire</a></b> grew by nearly 41,907 acres (16,959<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>ha) on August<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>1,<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>2026, doubling its size in just 24 hours?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinlahekin_Fire","retrieved":1790417152684},{"title":"Arlindo Lopes (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Brazilian actor <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arlindo_Lopes\" title=\"Arlindo Lopes\">Arlindo Lopes</a></b> portrayed the lead character in the stage adaptation of the 1971 American film <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harold_and_Maude\" title=\"Harold and Maude\">Harold and Maude</a></i> on three separate occasions between 2007 and 2022?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arlindo_Lopes","retrieved":1790417152685},{"title":"Henneguya ictaluri (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henneguya_ictaluri\" title=\"Henneguya ictaluri\">Henneguya ictaluri</a></b></i> can cause a devastating infectious disease in catfish known as hamburger gill disease?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henneguya_ictaluri","retrieved":1790417152686},{"title":"Tan Teck Chwee (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tan_Teck_Chwee\" title=\"Tan Teck Chwee\">Tan Teck Chwee</a></b> worked as a teacher, a granite quarry manager, and a shipyard chairman before heading Singapore's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_Service_Commission_(Singapore)\" title=\"Public Service Commission (Singapore)\">Public Service Commission</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tan_Teck_Chwee","retrieved":1790417152687},{"title":"Miner's Mountain Express (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miner's_Mountain_Express\" title=\"Miner's Mountain Express\">Miner's Mountain Express</a></b> at <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silver_Dollar_City\" title=\"Silver Dollar City\">Silver Dollar City</a> is set to be the longest family roller coaster in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midwestern_United_States\" title=\"Midwestern United States\">Midwestern United States</a> when it opens in 2027?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miner's_Mountain_Express","retrieved":1790417152689},{"title":"Paramita Bandara (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that principal <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramita_Bandara\" title=\"Paramita Bandara\">Paramita Bandara</a></b> said she had kept every card she received from students or teachers during her decades-long career?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramita_Bandara","retrieved":1790417152691},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;St. John's&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;BannerStJohns1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Colourful houses and military history await you in Canada's oldest and easternmost city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box